21. Dropdown
Dropdown — tugmani bosganda oldindan berilgan variantlar ro‘yxati ochiladi.
<div class="dropdown">

    <button class="btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle"
            type="button"
            data-toggle="dropdown">
        Dropdown Example
        <span class="caret"></span>
    </button>

    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
        <li><a href="#">HTML</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">CSS</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">JavaScript</a></li>
    </ul>

</div>
Asosiy qismlari:
.dropdown              → dropdown container
.dropdown-toggle       → dropdownni ochuvchi tugma
data-toggle="dropdown" → dropdownni ishga tushiradi
.caret                 → pastga qaragan strelka
.dropdown-menu         → ochiladigan menu
Divider — ajratuvchi chiziq
<li class="divider"></li>
Header — menu ichidagi sarlavha
<li class="dropdown-header">Languages</li>
Active va Disabled
<li class="active"><a href="#">HTML</a></li>
<li class="disabled"><a href="#">CSS</a></li>

